n(§9.1). OQ11 does not block H1; H2 preserves the arity until it is decided.\n\n## 14. For a successor orchestrator\n\nDecided (HD1-HD5, OQ1-OQ6, the split): the rule, the exact profile with\nownership laws, the H0-H4 sequence and gates, the deferral. Open: OQ7, OQ8,\nOQ11; none blocks H0 or H1; OQ7 is needed before H4; OQ11 before H2 may\ndrop or port the encoding arity (until then H2 preserves it). **What H1\nmust build beyond r7**: the two table B functions `dao.host.text/code-points`\nand `dao.host.float/decimal-text->float` with their tests (table D); the\nprofile count stays 76.\ngit: warning: confstr() failed with code 5: couldn't get path of DARWIN_USER_TEMP_DIR; using /tmp instead\ngit: error: couldn't create cache file '/tmp/xcrun_db-0RWj4lhy' (errno=Operation not permitted)\n2026-10-21 02:25:19.081 xcodebuild[13185:78485144]  DVTFilePathFSEvents: Failed to start fs event stream.\n2026-10-21 02:25:19.260 xcodebuild[13185:78485142] [MT] DVTDeveloperPaths: Failed to get length of DARWIN_USER_CACHE_DIR from confstr(3), error = Error Domain=NSPOSIXErrorDomain Code=5 \"Input/output error\". Using NSCachesDirectory instead.\ngit: warning: confstr() failed with code 5: couldn't get path of DARWIN_USER_TEMP_DIR; using /tmp instead\ngit: error: couldn't create cache file '/tmp/xcrun_db-ys1Uhc1u' (errno=Operation not permitted)\n2026-10-21 02:25:19.782 xcodebuild[13189:78485178]  DVTFilePathFSEvents: Failed to start fs event stream.\n2026-10-21 02:25:19.958 xcodebuild[13189:78485177] [MT] DVTDeveloperPaths: Failed to get length of DARWIN_USER_CACHE_DIR from confstr(3), error = Error Domain=NSPOSIXErrorDomain Code=5 \"Input/output error\". Using NSCachesDirectory instead.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
